      "id": 0,
      "message": "\u003ctg-emoji emoji-id=\"5456140674028019486\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"emoji\" style=\"background-image:url(\u0026#39;//telegram.org/img/emoji/40/E29AA1.png\u0026#39;)\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e⚡️\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/tg-emoji\u003e In one week, TON fees will drop 6× — to just 0.00039 TON (~$0.0005) per transaction, fixed regardless of network load.\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e\u003ctg-emoji emoji-id=\"5364112491381006601\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"emoji\" style=\"background-image:url(\u0026#39;//telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F8693.png\u0026#39;)\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e🆓\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/tg-emoji\u003e Soon after most transactions go fully feeless. Zero commission.\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e\u003ctg-emoji emoji-id=\"5296339823005557585\"\u003e\u003ci class=\"emoji\" style=\"background-image:url(\u0026#39;//telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09FAA99.png\u0026#39;)\"\u003e\u003cb\u003e🪙\u003c/b\u003e\u003c/i\u003e\u003c/tg-emoji\u003e \u003ca href=\"https://t.me/durov/482\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" onclick=\"return confirm(\u0026#39;Open this link?\\n\\n\u0026#39;+this.href);\"\u003eMTONGA\u003c/a\u003e",
